<%# The image registry refused the username or token. %>
<p>
  Kamal sends the built image to a registry, and your server downloads it from
  there. The registry refused the username or access token Roe used — tokens
  expire, and they're usually limited to certain permissions.
</p>

<ol>
  <li>Check the registry username and token in Settings → Deploy.</li>
  <li>The token needs permission to write (push) images, not only read them.</li>
  <li>If it's expired, make a new one at your registry and paste it into Settings → Deploy.</li>
  <li>Then deploy again.</li>
</ol>

<p>
  More detail:
  <a href="/documentation/roe/troubleshoot-deployment#troubleshooting-kamal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Troubleshooting → Deployment</a>
</p>
